            <text id="134:5667" name="Gradual adoption" x="0" y="0" width="376" height="28" />
            <text id="134:5668" name="Start small or go all in without extra work – Compose Multiplatform fits into your existing app, whether you’re sharing one component, one screen, or the entire UI. Keep your existing SwiftUI, Android Views, or Swing code – there’s no need to rewrite anything. Learn from the experience of other companies." x="0" y="52" width="376" height="168" />
          </frame>
